{
  "name": "Instagram Autopilot — Token Keeper",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "every-day-0800",
      "name": "Every Day 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/debug_token",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "input_token",
              "value": "={{ $env.IG_ACCESS_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $env.IG_ACCESS_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "check-token-health",
      "name": "Check Token Health",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\n// How many days until this token dies?\nconst d = $input.first().json?.data || {};\nconst expiresAt = Number(d.expires_at || 0);          // 0 = never expires\nconst valid = d.is_valid === true;\n\nlet daysLeft = 999;\nif (expiresAt > 0) {\n  daysLeft = Math.floor((expiresAt * 1000 - Date.now()) / 86400000);\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  valid,\n  days_left: daysLeft,\n  expires_human: expiresAt ? new Date(expiresAt * 1000).toISOString().slice(0, 10) : 'never',\n  needs_action: !valid || daysLeft <= 14,\n  scopes: (d.scopes || []).join(', '),\n} }];\n"
      },
      "id": "evaluate-expiry",
      "name": "Evaluate Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        140,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "nr",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.needs_action }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "needs-refresh?",
      "name": "Needs Refresh?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/oauth/access_token",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "grant_type",
              "value": "fb_exchange_token"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_id",
              "value": "={{ $env.META_APP_ID }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.META_APP_SECRET }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "fb_exchange_token",
              "value": "={{ $env.IG_ACCESS_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "exchange-for-new-token",
      "name": "Exchange For New Token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        580,
        200
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "PUT_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID_HERE",
        "text": "=🔑 INSTAGRAM TOKEN NEEDS ROTATING\n\nDays left on old token: {{ $('Evaluate Expiry').first().json.days_left }}\nExpires: {{ $('Evaluate Expiry').first().json.expires_human }}\n\nNEW TOKEN:\n{{ $json.access_token || 'EXCHANGE FAILED — generate manually in Graph API Explorer' }}\n\nACTION: paste it into the IG_ACCESS_TOKEN env var and restart n8n.\nUntil you do, posting will stop when the old token expires.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "notify-new-token",
      "name": "Notify: New Token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "token-healthy",
      "name": "Token Healthy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        580,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔑 TOKEN KEEPER\n\nInstagram long-lived tokens die after **60 days**.\nThis runs daily, checks how many days are left, and\nat 14 days out it mints a fresh one and Telegrams it to you.\n\nn8n cannot rewrite its own env var — you paste the new\ntoken into `IG_ACCESS_TOKEN` and restart. Two minutes,\ntwice a year, and the pipeline never silently dies.\n\nNeeds env vars: `META_APP_ID`, `META_APP_SECRET`, `IG_ACCESS_TOKEN`.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-token",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -300,
        -60
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Day 08:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Token Health",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Token Health": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Evaluate Expiry",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Evaluate Expiry": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Needs Refresh?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Needs Refresh?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Exchange For New Token",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Token Healthy",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Exchange For New Token": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Notify: New Token",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "instagram-autopilot-token"
  },
  "tags": []
}